{"id":"618173","name":"腌雪里蕻","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/618173/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"雪里蕻","amount":"350g"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"130g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"雪里蕻清洗晾晒到表面无水。","img":"images/618173/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红萝卜和生姜分别切丝。","img":"images/618173/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"雪里蕻切小段。","img":"images/618173/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅预热，中火，放姜丝。","img":"images/618173/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再放雪里蕻翻炒。","img":"images/618173/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放胡萝卜丝翻炒。","img":"images/618173/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放盐炒匀。","img":"images/618173/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒到冒水汽，关火。","img":"images/618173/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盛入碗中。","img":"images/618173/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装到玻璃瓶中。盖紧盖子。期待下饭菜。三天后可食用。","img":"images/618173/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}